Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add muse_spark text architecture (Muse Spark Open
 816B-A42B)

- architecture/muse_spark.py: MuseSparkForConditionalGeneration, text model only (vision/audio towers ignored)
- modules/arch_specific/muse_spark.py: latent MoE with fp32 sigmoid+bias router and per-expert
  input-scaled post norm, input-scaled RMSNorm, decoder block with learned residual gates
- Attention/SlidingAttention: optional weightless per-head o_norm ahead of the output gate
  (eager paths only; graphed decode and TP export decline it)
